## 12. Evidence — pre-integration questions answered, post-integration slots EMPTY until a real build

### [CXC-BUS-SCRIBE-EVIDENCE] Pre-integration questions (answered by this elevation pass) and post-integration evidence (EMPTY — never run)

- pre-integration questions answered by this elevation: (1) requirement predicates + acceptance criteria over every ratified/resolved node -> [CXC-BUS-SCRIBE-ACCEPTANCE]; (2) the activation-schema fork -> exactly the four named fields, activate-by-push mirroring the `_device/<id>/transport` precedent -> [CXC-BUS-SCRIBE-ACTIVATION-SCHEMA]; (3) an MCP tool-declaration surface, reusing [CXC-MCP-TOOL-DECLARATION]'s shape -> [CXC-BUS-SCRIBE-MCP-SURFACE].
- pre-integration questions LEFT open, flagged for David/architect ratify before or during build (not silently resolved): the actual numeric retention-default values (total bytes, per-profile caps, rotation thresholds) are marked "accepted as proposed" but no proposed numbers are captured anywhere in this document; the tension between this dispatch's "ComposeServer plugin" phrasing and [CXC-BUS-SCRIBE-DEPLOYMENT]'s ratified bare-Python-fleet-service shape, flagged in [CXC-BUS-SCRIBE-MCP-SURFACE]'s `note-on-deployment-shape`; whether tools 3 and 4's list/read seam is a bus query round-trip or a direct REST proxy, flagged in [CXC-BUS-SCRIBE-MCP-SURFACE]'s `resolution-note`.
- evidence-engine-real-load: EMPTY — no real bus_scribe process has recorded a real session; bus_scribe has never been built (no source exists in-repo as of this elevation's authoring, 2026-08-25).
- evidence-storage-budget-negative-control: EMPTY — BS-V7's negative-control fixture has not been run; no eviction/refusal has been observed under real pressure on real hardware.
- evidence-sink-split-real-catalog: EMPTY — no completed transcript has been cataloged to a real document_store instance.
- evidence-activation-real-push: EMPTY — no real `_scribe/<name>/activate` push has been observed to bind a profile end-to-end.
- evidence-mcp-surface-real-client: EMPTY — no real MCP client has invoked any of bus_scribe's four declared tools.
- why-empty-matters: per [DX-SPEC-CARRIES-ITS-EVIDENCE], "never run at all" must be a QUERYABLE PROPERTY, not something a reader has to already know — every slot above is `EMPTY` explicitly rather than simply absent, so a future query against this node can distinguish "not yet built" from "nobody thought to record it."
- status: draft
- status-detail: draft — every evidence slot EMPTY by construction; bus_scribe has not been implemented
- provenance: architect-recommendation
- part-of: [SPEC:CXC-BUS-SCRIBE]
- see-also: [DX-SPEC-CARRIES-ITS-EVIDENCE], [CXC-BUS-SCRIBE-ACCEPTANCE]

